        "created_at": "2013-08-11T18:47:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p><span>Icons reduce novice gamers interest in the game</span></p></blockquote><p>This has been repeated a couple of times as if it's fact, but it's unsubtantiated as far as I know. &nbsp;Excessive use of overly complicated icons almost certainly would. &nbsp;There's no evidence that limited use of simple icons would.</p>",
