      {
        "id": 70187,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-12T01:11:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Love the changes, Spiff! Truly things of beauty. I especially love the damage reduction and increase icons - great stuff! Thank you for putting them together.</p><p>Would you be willing to share the images (or fonts) you're using for the various icons?</p><p>Silverleaf, thank you for that link. I'll definitely be making use of that for my home-brewed cards!</p>",
