        "created_at": "2013-08-12T02:26:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p><span>Would you be willing to share the images (or fonts) you're using for the various icons?</span></p></blockquote><p><span>Sure. &nbsp;The \"SV:\" and \"EV:\" are just the CrashLanding font from Blambot overlayed with a gradient to make it look like the hp value does. &nbsp;The shield and explosion are just things I snatched off the internet. &nbsp;I've attached .png versions of each of those elements to this post.</span></p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/3p3iuBPxZbZBE4ITyiSNazQr6L4.zip\">icons.zip</a> (71.5 KB)</p>",
