      {
        "id": 70189,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-12T21:29:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\nYou can definitely feel free to gather and share any data you wish, and we'll definitely take a look!\n</blockquote>\nChallenge accepted. &nbsp;First step is to have some iconified cards for people to test out. &nbsp;In one afternoon of Photoshopping, here's what I came up with as <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/iconified_voss.zip\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">an iconified Grand Warlord Voss deck</a>&nbsp;(Voss having almost nothing but cards with start- or end-of-turn effects).\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Those look quite nice, if symbols were to be implemented.&nbsp; I'm not terribly invested in the idea, but if it happened like this I wouldn't have a problem with it.<br><br>I believe the Shock Infantry does 3 Lightning damage rather than 2, however.</p>",
