      {
        "id": 70191,
        "name": "Pushingthelimits",
        "username": "Pushingthelimits",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/82dd89/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-13T02:02:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I appreciate that the &gt;G team responded to this post. It was not the answer I wanted but it is their choice. In my opinion, they are not doing the best thing for the game by deciding to not make any changes. This game is so interesting storywise, but the mechanics of constantly checking the cards is slowing the game down without any upside.</p><p>I think the idea of bolding some specific words would be the simplest change for them to try. It introduces no new icons and there are no color blind issues.</p><p>It seems that for me, I will now get colored sharpies and start trying to underline or circle in a system that will work for me.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
